{"_id":"68a736128ec3d8323af14c60","nodeId":"g4UC0go7OPCJYJlac9w-i","roadmapSlug":"data-engineer","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.672Z","description":"# Database Fundamentals\n\nDatabase fundamentals cover the core concepts that apply across most relational database systems: how data is organized into tables, how queries are executed, and how the database ensures consistency and durability. Topics include normalization, indexing, transactions, and query optimization. These concepts apply whether using PostgreSQL, MySQL, or any other relational system.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Oracle: What is a Database?","url":"https://www.oracle.com/database/what-is-database/","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf530a"},{"type":"article","title":"NoSQL Explained","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/nosql-explained","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf530b"},{"type":"video","title":"What is Relational Database","url":"https://youtu.be/OqjJjpjDRLc","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf530c"},{"type":"video","title":"How do NoSQL Databases work","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0buKQHokLK8","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf530d"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:58.294Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417044","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Engineer in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/WOP6XG"},{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417100","title":"DataCamp - Data Engineer in Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/JkYLbr"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-engineer/content/g4UC0go7OPCJYJlac9w-i.md"}